    title: "Passengers describe stabbing on Israel-bound plane",
    summary: "Passengers on the Flydubai flight bound for Israel filmed the moments following the stabbing.",
    preview: "A pilot on an Israel-bound Flydubai flight stabbed another pilot and \"apparently tried to crash the plane\", Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu has said. The plane was travelling from Dubai to Tel Aviv when it plummeted 17,000ft (5,200m) in less than two minutes, before being diverted to Saudi Arabia. Eyewitnesses inside the plane described the moment the incident happened, with one man calling for help in a video shared on social media.",
    body: "A pilot on an Israel-bound Flydubai flight stabbed another pilot and \"apparently tried to crash the plane\", Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu has said.\n\nThe plane was travelling from Dubai to Tel Aviv when it plummeted 17,000ft (5,200m) in less than two minutes, before being diverted to Saudi Arabia.\n\nEyewitnesses inside the plane described the moment the incident happened, with one man calling for help in a video shared on social media.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- IsraelUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- DubaiUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Air travelUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- TravelUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Aviation accidents and incidentsUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Saudi ArabiaUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- TransportUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
